Delivery and sign-off gates
1. Safety first: USR-20 before any broad test run; isolate unit setup and repair deterministic
assertions (USR-19/21/22) alongside the relevant production changes.
2. Reproducibility: provision approved pinned dependencies/modern build tooling (USR-5);
confirm the DBA-owned deployed script contract before integration execution (USR-15).
3. Reliability: fix injected identity, outcome propagation and state finalization
(USR-16/1/9/13/17/18), with regression failures made explicit.
4. Data correctness: implement replacement/recovery contracts (USR-10/14), SQL parsing and
whole-request completion (USR-3/11), sender/configuration/IP and audit-reason fixes (USR-2/8/12/24). Business owners approve empty permissions and retry semantics.
5. Maintainability: reduce duplication and improve safe diagnostics/cancellation
(USR-4/6/7); agree initialization recovery before adding automatic retries (USR-23).
